# VFX-12 per-placement User Parameters (UE UNiagaraComponent::OverrideParameters): two placements of one system,
# Content/VFX/Demo/Impact.dfx (the engine Impact template made a looping demo: system Loop, emitters Infinite every
# 1.5 s, so the burst repeats in the editor viewport without Play), each with its own SurfaceNormal override.
# Scene Content/Scenes/VFX_Demo_Impacts.desce: ImpactUp at x=-150 (SurfaceNormal 0,1,0), ImpactPlusX at x=+150
# (SurfaceNormal 1,0,0). The edit goes through the Details write path (`set <entity> <Type>.<Field>`: the same
# reflected write, undo record and dirty scene as a hand edit); the User Parameters section then shows the row.
# The scenario dirties the scene but does not save it.
# p29: first the BROKEN-MATERIAL check (UE WorldGridMaterial), on its own test scene so the demo scene is opened
# clean afterwards: Content/VFX/Tests/VFX_Test_BrokenMaterial.dfx draws one 150 cm sprite with
# Content/VFX/Tests/M_Test_BrokenParticle.demat, whose Intensity is DELIBERATELY a scalar (the loader reads [x,y,z,w]).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/VFX_Test_BrokenParticleMaterial.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,30,320
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Дано run Panel "Open Particle Debugger"
Дано run Debug "Particles: Freeze"
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда state
Тогда 4a_broken_debugger the Particle Debugger (frozen) lists the BrokenMaterial emitter with Alive 1 (its burst of 1 survives Effects.SpawnCountScalePercent < 100) and BrokenMaterialRibbon with Alive > 0
Тогда-вид 4_broken the emitter whose material is broken draws a large square sprite filled with the grey world checker of the default surface (two greys, 100 cm cells), not a soft round disc; editor.log names M_Test_BrokenParticle, the field Params...Value and the checker fallback
Тогда-вид 4b_broken_ribbon below the sprite, a 60 cm wide ribbon trail running from the emitter along +X (second emitter BrokenMaterialRibbon, the same broken material) is filled with the same grey world checker, not the soft default ribbon; editor.log names the ribbon row's stand-in as well
Когда run Action Stop
Дано run Scene "Open Scene VFX_Demo_Impacts.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,30,320
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Дано run Panel "Open Particle Debugger"
# Simulate starts the effects from age zero (Scene::SetState resets the VFXWorld, as UE's fresh SIE world); the
# effects are frozen first so the shot is a chosen fixed step (6 x 1/60 s = 0.1 s), not wherever the clock lands.
Дано run Debug "Particles: Freeze"
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда state
Тогда-вид 1a_flipbook_early two steps in (1/30 s, early in the flash's 0.14-0.22 s life): each flash is the first cell of T_ImpactFlash - a broad glowing star with long thin rays (Kenney star_09), not a round blurred disc; the sparks are a fan of bright thin streaks (T_ImpactSpark) around it, plain to the eye
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда state
Тогда 0_debugger the Particle Debugger (frozen) lists Dust, Flash and Sparks of both ImpactUp and ImpactPlusX with Total spawned > 0 and Alive > 0 for Flash and Sparks
Когда state
Тогда-вид 1_impacts each impact shows a flash whose shape is a later cell of the T_ImpactFlash flipbook (a thinner four-ray star, different from 1a_flipbook_early) and a fan of bright velocity-aligned spark streaks textured from T_ImpactSpark, each tens of pixels long and plainly visible (not faint hairlines); the left one (x=-150) throws them upward, the right one (x=+150) sideways along +X - the difference is plain to the eye
Когда run Action Stop
Когда run Entity "Add to selection ImpactPlusX"
Когда set selected VFX.Overrides[0].Value 0,0,1,0
# A chosen moment, not wherever the editor clock lands: the effects restart from age zero and step 0.1 s, frozen.
Когда run Debug "Particles: Freeze"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Restart"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда run Debug "Particles: Step"
Когда state
Тогда 2_details Details of ImpactPlusX shows the "User Parameters" section with a ticked (overridden) Vec3 row SurfaceNormal = 0, 0, 1; in the viewport frozen 0.1 s after a restart, the right burst throws toward the camera (+Z, a round splash seen whole) while the left one still throws upward
